      "rev_n_2_f4e226_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_f4e226_1",
        "node_id": "n_2_f4e226",
        "thought_text": "Thought-1 (revised): To avoid the `IndexError` during the generation of transformations, ensure that the indices used in slicing operations do not go out of bounds. Specifically, check that `i-1`, `i+1`, and `i+2` are within the valid range before performing these operations. This can be done by adding conditional checks before accessing these indices. Additionally, consider using a more efficient method to generate transformations that avoids unnecessary computations and reduces the risk of errors.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_2_f4e226_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_d6eedffdd5",
        "created_at": 1794505791.6002665
      },
      "rev_n_3_9df472_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_9df472_1",
        "node_id": "n_3_9df472",
        "thought_text": "Thought-1 (revised): After processing all input, sort the keys of the dictionary alphabetically and print each key along with its associated set of similarly spelled word cores. Ensure that the sets of similarly spelled words are also sorted before printing them to maintain consistency.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_3_9df472_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_53d0ef6286",
