        "node_id": "n_5_6c593f",
        "thought_text": "Thought-2: Instead of using a Trie to store and query word cores directly, preprocess the input text to create a dictionary where keys are word cores and values are sets of words that share the same core. This approach simplifies finding similar words by checking if a transformed version of a word exists in the dictionary.",
