        "thought_text": "Thought-2 (revised): Instead of generating all possible transformations and checking each one individually, implement a more efficient method using a Trie data structure to store all valid word cores. Then, for each word core, perform a depth-first search (DFS) to explore all possible transformations within a single edit distance. This approach ensures that only valid transformations are considered, avoiding unnecessary computations and potential errors.",
